  "description": "Discontinued, superseded by Gen4. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic RocketMAX.\n\nYears of production: 2020-2022\n\nSee the RocketMAX archive for the other generations.\n\nThe RocketMAX Gen3 was Cotic's big wheel, 29er steel full suspension enduro bike: 160mm rear travel matched to a 160mm fork.\n\nThe fastest bike in the range, built for the rockiest descents and the steepest technical trails. Its Cotic developed Reynolds 853 frame and Longshot geometry carried speed through lines that would have been a fight on other bikes, with the stability and precision to stay composed on any gradient, and it still pedalled back up happily.",
